WEBVTT

00:01:38.610 --> 00:01:39.320
Shuuei.

00:01:40.450 --> 00:01:40.820
Yes?

00:01:42.240 --> 00:01:44.830
Shuurei is back in Kiyou.

00:01:45.700 --> 00:01:47.330
Aren't we glad she's come back safely?

00:01:47.750 --> 00:01:49.040
So, are you okay with that?

00:01:50.250 --> 00:01:52.210
Aren't you feeling uneasy about seeing her again?

00:01:52.840 --> 00:01:55.050
Since you demoted her to a joukan.

00:01:56.800 --> 00:01:59.890
Maybe Shuurei is angry about it.

00:02:11.190 --> 00:02:16.320
To Eigetsu and Kou Shuurei are relieved of their positions as provincial governors immediately.

00:02:17.150 --> 00:02:21.030
The current Kokushuu governor, Kai Yu, will assume this office.

00:02:23.530 --> 00:02:26.080
Th-Then what about the punishment for Officer Kou?

00:02:27.160 --> 00:02:30.580
After the transition, she will return to Kiyou immediately.

00:02:31.080 --> 00:02:34.420
Her official rank will be revoked, and she will be suspended.

00:02:35.500 --> 00:02:39.220
She will remain as a joukan until she is appointed to her next position.

00:02:47.600 --> 00:02:49.430
I couldn't help it.

00:02:49.940 --> 00:02:53.980
That was the only way to divert the people who oppose Shuurei.

00:02:53.980 --> 00:02:58.610
Even though her goal was to fight the disease in Sashuu and also Jyasen-kyou,

00:02:59.360 --> 00:03:04.990
which had been operating behind the scenes,
Shuurei's actions have irritated the higher officials.

00:03:06.790 --> 00:03:10.040
All for the people of Sashuu, huh?

00:03:12.880 --> 00:03:15.920
Kokushuu Governor Kai, I assume?

00:03:17.710 --> 00:03:23.430
I have invited you this time, because I have something that I want to pass on to you.

00:03:25.680 --> 00:03:26.390
A medical book.

00:03:27.560 --> 00:03:31.270
Why me... instead of Eigetsu-kun?

00:03:32.770 --> 00:03:35.810
Eigetsu does not have much time left either.

00:03:37.110 --> 00:03:43.740
Also, not long from now, To Eigetsu will disappear from this world.

00:03:45.700 --> 00:03:47.030
Excuse me for interrupting your conversation.

00:03:49.290 --> 00:03:51.460
Urgent letters for Governor Kou.

00:03:56.200 --> 00:03:56.960
What does it say?

00:03:57.540 --> 00:04:03.220
In Sashuu's Koringun, a strange disease is spreading, and Eigetsu-kun has headed that way alone.

00:04:03.720 --> 00:04:04.340
A disease?

00:04:05.050 --> 00:04:06.180
You can't perform the treatments?

00:04:10.930 --> 00:04:13.100
Could you please tell me the reason?

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:16.400
This illness is caused by a worm.

00:04:16.830 --> 00:04:17.360
A worm?

00:04:17.620 --> 00:04:19.270
According to this description,

00:04:19.780 --> 00:04:25.240
the snow foxes living in the uplands of the Senri
Mountains appear to be the carriers of the worms.

00:04:25.860 --> 00:04:27.990
The most likely cause of a mass outbreak is that

00:04:27.990 --> 00:04:33.910
the snow foxes drop feces containing worm eggs into the wells and rivers,

00:04:33.910 --> 00:04:36.630
and people drink the contaminated water without realizing it.

00:04:36.960 --> 00:04:37.670
Water?

00:04:38.500 --> 00:04:44.260
The eggs in the water hatch in your body and develop, and then you fall ill?

00:04:44.260 --> 00:04:45.380
Yes.

00:04:45.380 --> 00:04:47.220
There must be some way...

00:04:47.840 --> 00:04:50.510
Are you saying there is no treatment, even in that medical book?

00:04:51.390 --> 00:04:54.020
There is one possibility.

00:04:54.350 --> 00:04:54.890
What is it?

00:04:57.480 --> 00:04:59.150
Surgery on humans.

00:05:00.150 --> 00:05:04.570
Human surgery carries a high risk.

00:05:05.110 --> 00:05:08.660
As I am now, with my blurred eyesight and shaking hands,

00:05:08.660 --> 00:05:11.200
it's impossible for me to perform surgery on humans.

00:05:15.000 --> 00:05:16.580
I might know someone!

00:05:17.670 --> 00:05:20.140
It's a doctor who travels around the country.

00:05:20.140 --> 00:05:22.750
I don't know where he is nowadays...

00:05:22.750 --> 00:05:24.010
Is that perhaps...

00:05:24.670 --> 00:05:26.430
The greatest doctor of the present era...

00:05:26.800 --> 00:05:30.300
The great wandering doctor who never stays in one place.

00:05:31.430 --> 00:05:32.810
Wh-What is his name?

00:05:33.640 --> 00:05:38.770
It's been a while, Shuurei-jouchan. Have you been well?

00:05:39.560 --> 00:05:39.980
Yo...

00:05:41.440 --> 00:05:42.770
You-sensei!

00:05:44.360 --> 00:05:45.940
So, can you do it?

00:05:45.940 --> 00:05:47.610
Well, yes, I can.

00:05:48.570 --> 00:05:50.660
So, you will perform the art of surgery on humans?

00:05:51.370 --> 00:05:54.910
If it is Jouchan's request, I cannot refuse to undertake the task.

00:05:55.540 --> 00:05:57.500
They can be saved. We can save them.

00:05:58.290 --> 00:05:59.460
What remains to be done is...

00:06:08.510 --> 00:06:11.510
Has the Merchants Guild taken action, Governor Kou?

00:06:11.760 --> 00:06:14.350
Yes, they will provide full assistance.

00:06:14.850 --> 00:06:16.810
In three days time, I will depart for Sashuu.

00:06:17.390 --> 00:06:22.900
I would like to take this occasion to announce that Tei Yuushun and I are departing.

00:06:26.690 --> 00:06:27.780
H-Hold on!

00:06:29.240 --> 00:06:32.160
You have gone too far in just one day!

00:06:32.410 --> 00:06:33.910
This is almost like asking for ex-post-facto approval!

00:06:33.910 --> 00:06:36.100
On top of that, you obtained their agreement through bluffing.

00:06:36.100 --> 00:06:37.870
What do you think is the purpose of the Imperial Court?!

00:06:38.290 --> 00:06:41.370
I thought its purpose was to help our people,

00:06:41.370 --> 00:06:42.630
but am I wrong?

00:06:43.880 --> 00:06:46.760
If the answer is different, please tell me.

00:06:47.380 --> 00:06:49.220
What do you think is the purpose of the Imperial Court?

00:06:50.470 --> 00:06:53.140
If we followed normal procedure, it would be too late.

00:06:53.640 --> 00:06:56.770
As government officials, whom should we protect?

00:06:58.230 --> 00:07:03.860
There are matters that an individual cannot accomplish, but I have power now!

00:07:04.400 --> 00:07:06.230
I have persuaded the Merchants Guild.

00:07:06.650 --> 00:07:08.900
I have managed to gather skilled physicians!

00:07:09.360 --> 00:07:11.150
In three days, I will depart for Sashuu.

00:07:11.700 --> 00:07:14.490
Within half a month, I will arrive at Koringun and begin the treatments.

00:07:15.530 --> 00:07:19.000
The Kou Shuurei of a year ago could not have done this.

00:07:21.370 --> 00:07:23.670
I could not do this now if I had not received my office and rank!

00:07:26.090 --> 00:07:29.630
What is the point of having power, if one does not make use of it?

00:07:32.970 --> 00:07:36.260
In these hands, there is the power to save people!

00:07:38.520 --> 00:07:41.140
You are returning to Sashuu, no matter what?

00:07:41.140 --> 00:07:42.390
Of course.

00:07:42.690 --> 00:07:44.190
No matter what is said, or by whom,

00:07:44.190 --> 00:07:46.020
for the sake of the official rank that I was given...

00:07:46.610 --> 00:07:48.190
and for the sake of this flower,

00:07:48.190 --> 00:07:49.820
I will return to Sashuu.

00:07:56.780 --> 00:08:00.950
Go and accomplish what you need to, Sashuu Governor Kou Shuurei!

00:08:02.660 --> 00:08:03.290
Yes, Your Highness.

00:08:12.130 --> 00:08:14.050
Where have you been, Kouyuu?

00:08:15.220 --> 00:08:17.600
If you've moved your office, why didn't you tell me so beforehand?!

00:08:18.010 --> 00:08:19.600
We haven't moved.

00:08:19.600 --> 00:08:22.560
Don't lie to me! I won't be fooled!

00:08:22.890 --> 00:08:23.980
It's not a lie.

00:08:24.520 --> 00:08:27.310
Why would I lie anyway?!

00:08:24.940 --> 00:08:26.730
He got lost again...

00:08:35.990 --> 00:08:37.030
Impassable?

00:08:38.120 --> 00:08:38.580
What?

00:08:39.280 --> 00:08:40.120
Where's the flag of the Imperial Army?

00:08:40.450 --> 00:08:42.620
It's on display! They must've seen it!

00:08:51.420 --> 00:08:55.430
You lot! What on earth are you fools thinking?!

00:08:57.140 --> 00:08:57.760
Ouch!

00:09:03.680 --> 00:09:04.600
Ensei!

00:09:05.270 --> 00:09:06.810
Ensei! Ensei!

00:09:07.850 --> 00:09:09.310
It can't be anyone but Ensei!

00:09:09.980 --> 00:09:13.610
Well, this sure is a passionate welcome, Princess!

00:09:19.450 --> 00:09:20.780
It doesn't feel right, does it?

00:09:21.740 --> 00:09:25.540
The others are going to the most dangerous place, yet...

00:09:25.960 --> 00:09:26.790
True...

00:09:27.790 --> 00:09:34.920
But I sort of understand how Governor Kou felt when she refused to send the Imperial Army.

00:09:36.010 --> 00:09:39.550
As a Governor of Sashuu, I refuse the offer of intervention by the Imperial Army.

00:09:40.180 --> 00:09:45.560
Why do you think Governor To and the others have postponed dispatching Sashuu's army until now?

00:09:47.730 --> 00:09:52.650
Numerous innocent people have joined Jyasen-kyou,
believing that this would protect them from falling ill.

00:09:53.730 --> 00:10:00.240
Is it not obvious what action Jyasen-kyou will take when they hear that the Imperial Army is intervening?

00:10:01.320 --> 00:10:05.750
Use of the Imperial Army will solve the problem with Jyasen-kyou by force.

00:10:05.750 --> 00:10:08.710
But, how many lives will be lost that way?

00:10:10.130 --> 00:10:14.300
The reason why I am venturing into Jyasen-kyou territory is not in order to stir things up.

00:10:14.750 --> 00:10:20.390
They must want to contact me if they say they will capture me and make me a human sacrifice.

00:10:20.390 --> 00:10:23.560
First, we must respond urgently to the outbreak of disease,

00:10:23.560 --> 00:10:27.390
then I will come up with a plan to deal with Jyasen-kyou cautiously and swiftly.

00:10:27.390 --> 00:10:30.940
Giving priority to saving people's lives, I will bring this problem to an end!

00:10:31.980 --> 00:10:37.740
Refusing the escort of the Imperial Army meant that she stood against the Emperor's decision,

00:10:37.740 --> 00:10:40.700
in order to protect Ran-shogun and the others.

00:10:41.910 --> 00:10:43.530
To make the point that our lives aren't that unimportant.

00:10:45.200 --> 00:10:46.700
Government officials are amazing.

00:10:47.160 --> 00:10:50.580
Depending on their decisions, they can protect their people like this.

00:10:58.010 --> 00:11:00.590
I couldn't help at all, that time.

00:11:01.590 --> 00:11:04.010
Nobody can be saved by military force.

00:11:04.930 --> 00:11:06.640
Shuurei-dono taught me that.

00:11:07.140 --> 00:11:10.480
Government officials can protect lives without military force.

00:11:10.770 --> 00:11:13.610
True... Military force is not the only power.

00:11:15.270 --> 00:11:20.530
Oh, yes, Shuurei-dono has handed in her report on this case.

00:11:20.530 --> 00:11:21.950
What? From Shuurei?!

00:11:23.320 --> 00:11:25.030
Read it? Read it?

00:11:25.030 --> 00:11:26.370
Yes, let's read it!

00:11:36.210 --> 00:11:38.250
You endured this well.

00:11:39.300 --> 00:11:41.930
Well done. You'll be fine now.

00:11:41.930 --> 00:11:43.840
You'll be on your feet soon.

00:11:54.650 --> 00:11:56.560
Look, I've removed it.

00:11:58.020 --> 00:11:58.900
Wait!

00:11:58.900 --> 00:12:00.010
Let me go!

00:12:00.490 --> 00:12:04.030
I can't do this! I could never do this!

00:12:04.030 --> 00:12:06.740
Okay, I nearly fainted a few times too, but...

00:12:07.160 --> 00:12:08.700
You mustn't give up!

00:12:08.700 --> 00:12:10.370
We've practiced so many times!

00:12:10.700 --> 00:12:13.370
Well then, can you do it?

00:12:15.080 --> 00:12:16.790
To cut open the human body...

00:12:18.250 --> 00:12:19.710
So much blood spilled out.

00:12:21.760 --> 00:12:25.090
I might... kill them.

00:12:28.050 --> 00:12:31.310
I can't do it. I don't have the confidence!

00:12:32.560 --> 00:12:33.140
Excuse me...

00:12:36.060 --> 00:12:37.480
Where are the doctors?

00:12:39.400 --> 00:12:41.360
I've come from a village beyond the mountain.

00:12:42.240 --> 00:12:47.070
The doctors... I heard that there are doctors here who can treat this.

00:12:51.240 --> 00:12:53.410
Please save my child... Please!

00:13:03.590 --> 00:13:04.510
Please!

00:13:04.920 --> 00:13:09.930
I'd give my life to save my child. I beg you!

00:13:13.680 --> 00:13:15.940
I-It'll be all right now.

00:13:16.690 --> 00:13:19.400
I'm a doctor.

00:13:23.110 --> 00:13:27.740
I'm a doctor. I became a doctor to save people.

00:13:28.700 --> 00:13:31.200
Now, come with me. We'll save your child.

00:13:32.080 --> 00:13:33.330
Thank you very much!

00:13:35.000 --> 00:13:37.460
Nobody ever said that to me until now.

00:13:42.460 --> 00:13:45.260
I can't save anybody if I run.

00:13:46.170 --> 00:13:47.260
Bring medicine!

00:13:47.260 --> 00:13:48.050
Over here too!

00:13:48.050 --> 00:13:49.260
Acupuncturists as well!

00:13:58.690 --> 00:14:00.360
Well then, just do it!

00:14:00.690 --> 00:14:02.520
I'll take all the responsibility!

00:14:06.570 --> 00:14:09.530
Apparently, the outbreak of disease down the mountain has been contained.

00:14:10.240 --> 00:14:14.740
A woman governor found the cure and rushed over from the capital.

00:14:16.040 --> 00:14:17.250
Isn't that great?

00:14:17.660 --> 00:14:20.080
That seemed to really worry you.

00:14:21.790 --> 00:14:25.210
Don't use that rotten laugh with that face.

00:14:25.960 --> 00:14:27.380
How often do I have to say it?

00:14:27.800 --> 00:14:28.760
Oh, what's this?

00:14:29.260 --> 00:14:33.510
I heard you were going to perish soon, but you're clinging adamantly to life.

00:14:33.890 --> 00:14:35.180
Do you understand this?

00:14:35.180 --> 00:14:37.600
Eigetsu, you're not what we want.

00:14:38.100 --> 00:14:39.770
Why don't you just die?

00:14:43.310 --> 00:14:45.860
And... And then what happened to Eigetsu?

00:14:45.860 --> 00:14:48.650
Don't rush! We're gonna read it now.

00:14:48.650 --> 00:14:49.650
Eigetsu!

00:14:50.530 --> 00:14:51.870
Please live!

00:14:51.870 --> 00:14:55.910
It's already over. You know he's all right.

00:14:55.910 --> 00:14:58.580
Don't say that. I was just joking.

00:14:58.580 --> 00:14:59.870
This isn't the time to joke!

00:14:59.870 --> 00:15:01.080
Why not?!

00:15:01.080 --> 00:15:03.460
We can joke about it because he's all right!

00:15:12.090 --> 00:15:13.010
Kourin-san?

00:15:16.970 --> 00:15:19.230
Why... are you here?

00:15:19.680 --> 00:15:23.060
What's this?! How could you be so stupid as to get caught in a place like this?!

00:15:25.820 --> 00:15:30.070
Go back. There's no reason for you to stay here.

00:15:31.400 --> 00:15:33.110
Now, go back.

00:16:08.980 --> 00:16:13.740
So called founder of Jyasen-kyou, Senya, and its followers!

00:16:13.740 --> 00:16:15.160
You have exploited this epidemic.

00:16:15.160 --> 00:16:19.200
You have used lies to kidnap the residents of Sekiei and nearby villages,

00:16:19.660 --> 00:16:21.500
to rob them, and to imprison them.

00:16:21.500 --> 00:16:23.710
This is a grave offense.

00:16:24.620 --> 00:16:26.920
You will be taken into custody and punished for your crimes!

00:16:28.210 --> 00:16:30.760
You will be arrested immediately. Stay where you are!

00:16:31.710 --> 00:16:33.880
It wasn't a lie.

00:16:33.880 --> 00:16:38.010
I did tell them to boil the water before using it.

00:16:38.510 --> 00:16:41.850
They ignored it, so it's their own fault.

00:16:41.850 --> 00:16:43.770
Stop talking nonsense!

00:16:44.730 --> 00:16:48.560
You didn't care if the villagers were going to become sick...

00:16:49.190 --> 00:16:50.230
did you?!

00:16:50.230 --> 00:16:51.440
Well, no.

00:16:52.190 --> 00:16:53.110
So?

00:16:53.110 --> 00:16:58.370
But, the true owner of that body you're using right now was different!

00:16:59.660 --> 00:17:00.490
Eigetsu-kun...

00:17:00.990 --> 00:17:04.080
We'll discuss whether or not I'll leave this body another time.

00:17:04.960 --> 00:17:08.670
Right now, our target is the woman over there.

00:17:09.540 --> 00:17:10.800
Yeah, you.

00:17:11.210 --> 00:17:16.130
You came to rescue the people here with no guards, didn't you?

00:17:16.510 --> 00:17:20.220
If you come with me, we'll release all the villagers.

00:17:20.220 --> 00:17:24.020
We removed all the villagers earlier this morning.

00:17:24.520 --> 00:17:26.020
Wh-What?!

00:17:33.280 --> 00:17:36.320
You here are the last ones to be arrested.

00:17:37.030 --> 00:17:39.740
Ren, your plan has failed.

00:17:40.320 --> 00:17:44.080
At this stage, you're no longer needed.

00:17:47.500 --> 00:17:49.750
I don't even have a body to return to anymore.

00:17:49.750 --> 00:17:53.550
I just need to admit that I'm dead.

00:17:57.130 --> 00:17:57.880
See ya...

00:18:07.060 --> 00:18:07.940
Doushu-sama...

00:18:10.440 --> 00:18:11.690
Were you happy?

00:18:13.020 --> 00:18:13.820
Doushu-sama...

00:18:31.580 --> 00:18:32.210
It can't be...

00:18:33.290 --> 00:18:34.880
H-Hey! Eigetsu!

00:18:36.420 --> 00:18:37.260
Eigetsu-kun...

00:18:38.260 --> 00:18:39.430
Eigetsu-kun!

00:18:39.840 --> 00:18:40.680
Eigetsu-sama!

00:18:50.100 --> 00:18:53.150
The disease outbreak was resolved, and Jyasen-kyou defeated,

00:18:51.730 --> 00:18:53.150
Eigetsu!

00:18:53.150 --> 00:18:54.570
so the case is over.

00:18:53.480 --> 00:18:54.570
Eigetsu's been...

00:18:54.570 --> 00:18:55.940
Eigetsu's been...!

00:18:55.020 --> 00:18:57.990
No, according to Seiran's report,

00:18:56.360 --> 00:19:00.360
What a tragedy! I could do nothing for him!

00:18:57.990 --> 00:19:01.780
there are signs that the Hyou family was involved in this case.

00:19:00.820 --> 00:19:02.660
Eigetsu has suff-

00:19:03.030 --> 00:19:06.160
The Hyou family... Are they planning something?

00:19:06.560 --> 00:19:08.290
We'd better watch their moves.

00:19:08.790 --> 00:19:09.210
Yeah.

00:19:09.660 --> 00:19:10.580
The Hyou family...

00:19:17.760 --> 00:19:18.670
The Hyou family was...

00:19:19.630 --> 00:19:22.010
No, I'll think about it later.

00:19:22.430 --> 00:19:23.010
Right now...

00:19:23.590 --> 00:19:25.260
Eigetsu!

00:19:25.260 --> 00:19:27.470
Eigetsu has...!

00:19:26.220 --> 00:19:28.100
Cut it out!

00:19:31.100 --> 00:19:32.230
Eigetsu-kun!

00:19:33.900 --> 00:19:34.810
It's not him.

00:19:41.030 --> 00:19:42.240
Eigetsu is dead.

00:19:43.610 --> 00:19:46.370
He's not in this world anymore.

00:19:57.750 --> 00:19:58.500
Kourin!

00:20:27.450 --> 00:20:28.830
Kourin-san.

00:20:30.660 --> 00:20:31.580
Kourin-san.

00:20:34.330 --> 00:20:35.210
Kourin-san?

00:20:38.920 --> 00:20:40.250
How are you feeling?

00:20:43.130 --> 00:20:44.840
Eigetsu-sama?

00:20:45.380 --> 00:20:46.260
That's right.

00:20:47.800 --> 00:20:50.100
Yougetsu has given me life.

00:20:51.350 --> 00:20:53.180
Enough for me to die of old age.

00:21:01.610 --> 00:21:02.860
K-Kourin-san?

00:21:03.690 --> 00:21:10.030
I won't forgive you if you ever disappear again.

00:21:11.450 --> 00:21:12.250
Kourin-san.

00:21:18.380 --> 00:21:20.460
Oh, I'm so glad!

00:21:20.800 --> 00:21:23.010
So glad that Eigetsu came back to life!

00:21:22.670 --> 00:21:24.380
Like I said, you knew that!

00:21:24.380 --> 00:21:27.590
What's wrong with enjoying happy moments more than once?!

00:21:28.010 --> 00:21:31.390
Now, Kouyuu, Shuuei, you need to feel happy too!

00:21:32.010 --> 00:21:35.480
The dispute has been resolved, and Shuurei and Eigetsu are safe. I'm glad!

00:21:35.890 --> 00:21:36.940
Three, two and...

00:21:38.400 --> 00:21:39.900
I'm glad they're safe.

00:21:40.190 --> 00:21:41.770
Louder!

00:21:42.280 --> 00:21:44.030
I'm glad they're safe!

00:21:44.610 --> 00:21:45.440
Yeah!

00:21:47.150 --> 00:21:48.910
Shuurei-onee-chan!

00:21:50.530 --> 00:21:51.530
Shuuran...

00:21:53.330 --> 00:21:56.000
Shuurei-onee-chan, thanks for coming.

00:21:57.210 --> 00:22:01.750
Thanks for coming to Sekiei Village, to Korin, to Sashuu!

00:22:02.630 --> 00:22:04.710
I was really, really happy to see you!

00:22:07.220 --> 00:22:09.800
Now I've got something I want to be.

00:22:10.090 --> 00:22:12.600
Oh, I know, a doctor?

00:22:12.970 --> 00:22:16.600
No, I'm gonna be an officer!

00:22:19.270 --> 00:22:23.610
I'll become a government official like you and save people!

00:22:24.820 --> 00:22:26.860
Then, whatever happens...

00:22:28.700 --> 00:22:31.620
I have to do my best until Shuuran comes to the Imperial Court!

00:22:32.280 --> 00:22:33.870
Ojou-sama, over there.

00:22:47.550 --> 00:22:50.220
Everyone, thank you!

00:22:53.220 --> 00:22:55.720
We had no choice except to demote her to joukan,

00:22:55.720 --> 00:22:57.480
but Shuurei-dono has done well.

00:22:58.020 --> 00:22:59.600
Yes, I know.

00:23:01.350 --> 00:23:05.900
Well, she got back safely. That's enough.

00:23:06.440 --> 00:23:09.150
Let her slap you for demoting her to joukan!

00:23:09.150 --> 00:23:11.820
Yeah, he deserves that.

00:23:13.160 --> 00:23:18.910
N-Nah, I think Shuurei understands my feelings.

00:23:19.290 --> 00:23:22.000
I hope that... she does...

00:23:22.630 --> 00:23:23.250
You won't...

00:23:23.960 --> 00:23:25.340
slap me, will you,

00:23:26.000 --> 00:23:26.960
Shuurei?

00:24:45.000 --> 00:24:47.420
I've become a joukan and have been suspended for the time being.

00:24:47.920 --> 00:24:51.010
But I can't play around just because I have free time.

00:24:51.630 --> 00:24:53.800
Does something need to be done? Is there something I can do?

00:24:54.260 --> 00:24:55.800
What? A golden raccoon?

00:24:56.260 --> 00:24:57.220
A raccoon's gold?
